WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.107
- I always find it fascinating
- I twisted my ankle

00:00:01.107 --> 00:00:02.180
a couple of years ago.

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:04.320
- With actors that I love.

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:05.700
I hear these stories of like,

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.760
sometimes right before they
broke big, they almost quit,

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.540
and I heard that that was you.

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:11.550
- Yeah, totally.

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:16.550
I mean, I think, my wife and
I had just had our daughter

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:21.930
and nothing was really happening
on the acting front for me,

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:25.670
and it just felt selfish to
sort of move forward with it

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:26.590
at some point.

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:31.590
And I guess, luckily, I
didn't have any backup plan

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:33.950
or skills whatsoever.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:35.510
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:36.730
So sort of weighting it out

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:39.540
and trying to look for
other jobs here and there

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:40.763
that were not acting,

00:00:42.123 --> 00:00:44.250
and then I had gotten
the "New Girl" audition,

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.960
and sort of went into that,

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:48.260
had already quit, (chuckles)

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:51.160
was looking for other employment

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:52.900
and thought that I would never get it

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:55.620
cause there were so many
incredible people involved in it.

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.770
You know, it's one of those jobs where,

00:00:57.770 --> 00:00:59.550
you know, you have Zooey coming off of

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:01.710
a really successful movie career.

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:03.900
Jake Kasdan was directing in,

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:05.640
Meriwether had written
it and you are like,

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:07.173
well, I'll never get this.

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:10.123
And then I got really lucky.

00:01:10.123 --> 00:01:12.140
- I think that almost helps
sometimes when you're like,

00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:13.510
well, this isn't gonna happen,

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:14.640
so I'll just go in and have a good time

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:16.170
and then I'm probably gonna
quit and do something else.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:17.630
You probably, that helped you?

00:01:17.630 --> 00:01:19.440
- Yeah, it takes all
the stakes away from it,

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:21.220
and especially the personal stakes.

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:24.840
And yeah, I definitely
think it helped a lot.

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:26.160
- Yeah. Well, I'm glad you didn't quit

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:28.510
cause you're hilarious
and one of my favorites.

